<section class="sect" id="chamber" aria-labelledby="chamberTitle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">What your chamber gets</span>
    <h2 id="chamberTitle">A signature program that runs every month</h2>
    <div class="cards cards--3">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Engagement</span>
        <h3>A reason to show up</h3>
        <p>A monthly game members look forward to. Not another lecture: they make decisions, compete with each other and see the results.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Non-dues revenue</span>
        <h3>Income, not just cost</h3>
        <p>You sell the tickets and keep every dollar. One Elite game for management teams can pay for the whole year.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Sponsorship</span>
        <h3>Free with a sponsor</h3>
        <p>A local bank or another sponsor can pay for the program. You get a ready-made sponsor package and prospectus to send them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Networking</span>
        <h3>Networking with substance</h3>
        <p>Two hours of competing for the same customers tells members more about each other than any mixer.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Turnkey</span>
        <h3>You provide the room</h3>
        <p>Our host runs the game by video on your big screen. You get invitation texts for every month; members play on their phones or laptops.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__tag">Impact</span>
        <h3>Proof for your board</h3>
        <p>A short report after every game: who played, which businesses took part and what they took away.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
